---
description: Bump web/api package version on significant changes; CI derives release tags from them.
alwaysApply: true
---

On significant changes, bump `version` in `web/package.json` and/or `api/package.json` per semantic versioning. Root `package.json` version is **not** used for release image tags. `libs/shared-types/package.json` has its own independent version.

CI (`.github/workflows/build-and-push.yml`):
- **`main` pushes** — reads `web`/`api` versions and publishes `v<version>`, `latest`, `sha-<short_sha>` per component.
- **`dev` pushes** — publishes `<component>-dev-<full_commit_sha>` and `<component>-dev-latest`; no semver `v*` tags.
